1
00:00:00,300 --> 00:00:02,330
苹果第一台折叠屏刚开卖，
Apple's first foldable just went on sale,

2
00:00:02,330 --> 00:00:04,320
热搜就被一层膜承包了。
and one thin film took over the trending list.

3
00:00:04,320 --> 00:00:06,750
有人发现，内屏那层磨砂膜，
People found the matte film on the inner screen

4
00:00:06,750 --> 00:00:08,370
用手就能撕下来。
peels off by hand.

5
00:00:08,370 --> 00:00:11,500
撕完想贴回去？官方售后398元。
Want it back on? 398 yuan at Apple service.

6
00:00:11,500 --> 00:00:15,340
要是把屏弄坏了，据报道换内屏将近八千。
Damage the screen, and a new one reportedly costs nearly 8,000.

7
00:00:15,340 --> 00:00:17,620
国行起售价15999元，
It starts at 15,999 yuan in China,

8
00:00:17,620 --> 00:00:20,590
这层膜成了全网最贵的一张贴纸。
and this film became the internet's priciest sticker.

9
00:00:20,590 --> 00:00:22,610
今天的问题：一块玻璃，
Today's question: how can a sheet of glass

10
00:00:22,610 --> 00:00:24,020
凭什么能对折？
fold in half?

11
00:00:24,020 --> 00:00:25,300
认识一下小折。
Meet Foldy.

12
00:00:25,300 --> 00:00:27,050
一台会对折的手机。
A phone that bends in half.

13
00:00:27,050 --> 00:00:28,480
普通手机的玻璃，
Would you dare fold

14
00:00:28,480 --> 00:00:29,670
你敢对折吗？
an ordinary phone's glass?

15
00:00:29,670 --> 00:00:30,190
咔嚓。
Crack.

16
00:00:30,190 --> 00:00:32,370
玻璃很硬，可是一弯就碎。
Glass is hard, but it snaps when bent.

17
00:00:32,370 --> 00:00:34,300
为什么？因为弯的时候，
Why? Because when you bend something,

18
00:00:34,300 --> 00:00:35,650
外侧要被拉长。
the outside has to stretch.

19
00:00:35,650 --> 00:00:36,830
而玻璃最怕拉：
And glass hates stretching:

20
00:00:36,830 --> 00:00:39,980
表面一道看不见的小裂纹，一拉就裂开。
one invisible tiny flaw, and it rips open.

21
00:00:39,980 --> 00:00:41,460
秘密在一个公式里：
The secret is one formula:

22
00:00:41,460 --> 00:00:46,150
弯的时候，表面拉长的比例，约等于厚度除以两倍的弯曲半径。
bend something, and its surface stretches by about thickness over twice the bend radius.

23
00:00:46,150 --> 00:00:47,150
翻译成人话：
In plain words:

24
00:00:47,150 --> 00:00:48,600
越薄，越弯得动。
the thinner it is, the more it can bend.

25
00:00:48,600 --> 00:00:50,000
一本书你折不动，
You can't fold a whole book,

26
00:00:50,000 --> 00:00:51,350
一张纸随便折。
but a single page folds easily.

27
00:00:51,350 --> 00:00:54,600
我们粗算一下：0.5毫米的普通玻璃，
Our rough math: half-millimeter glass

28
00:00:54,600 --> 00:00:58,140
弯到半径2毫米，表面要拉长大约12%。
bent to a 2-millimeter radius would stretch about 12 percent.

29
00:00:58,140 --> 00:01:00,070
可玻璃拉长1%左右，
But glass breaks

30
00:01:00,070 --> 00:01:00,960
就碎了。
at roughly 1 percent stretch.

31
00:01:00,960 --> 00:01:03,120
所以折叠屏用的是超薄玻璃，
So foldables use ultra-thin glass,

32
00:01:03,120 --> 00:01:05,070
业内常见大约30微米。
often around 30 microns.

33
00:01:05,070 --> 00:01:06,100
比一根头发，
That's half the thickness

34
00:01:06,100 --> 00:01:07,250
还要薄一半。
of a human hair.

35
00:01:07,250 --> 00:01:08,780
同样弯到2毫米，
Bent to the same 2 millimeters,

36
00:01:08,780 --> 00:01:10,800
表面只拉长不到1%。
it stretches less than 1 percent.

37
00:01:10,800 --> 00:01:11,740
一样是玻璃，
Same glass.

38
00:01:11,740 --> 00:01:14,860
薄到一定程度，就从“碎”变成了“弯”。
Make it thin enough, and 'shatter' becomes 'bend'.

39
00:01:14,860 --> 00:01:16,890
反转一：薄到这个程度，
Twist one: that thin,

40
00:01:16,890 --> 00:01:18,670
玻璃就像纸一样软。
glass turns floppy like paper.

41
00:01:18,670 --> 00:01:19,750
可它也很娇气，
But it's also delicate.

42
00:01:19,750 --> 00:01:20,800
怕划，怕戳。
It hates scratches and pokes.

43
00:01:20,800 --> 00:01:23,110
所以最上面要盖一层保护层。
So a protective layer sits on top.

44
00:01:23,110 --> 00:01:25,180
你撕的，就是它的铠甲。
That film you peeled is its armor.

45
00:01:25,180 --> 00:01:28,100
反转二：屏幕是好多层叠在一起的，
Twist two: the screen is a stack of layers,

46
00:01:28,100 --> 00:01:29,670
像一块千层蛋糕。
like a layer cake.

47
00:01:29,670 --> 00:01:31,530
弯的时候，外面被拉，
When it bends, the outside stretches

48
00:01:31,530 --> 00:01:32,580
里面被挤。
and the inside squeezes.

49
00:01:32,580 --> 00:01:34,810
中间有一层，不拉也不挤，
In between, one layer does neither.

50
00:01:34,810 --> 00:01:35,860
叫中性层。
It's called the neutral layer.

51
00:01:35,860 --> 00:01:37,500
就像对折一本杂志：
Like folding a magazine:

52
00:01:37,500 --> 00:01:41,060
封面被拉，封底被挤，中间的书页最轻松。
the cover stretches, the back squeezes, the middle pages relax.

53
00:01:41,060 --> 00:01:43,050
工程师把最怕拉的东西，
Engineers tuck the most fragile parts

54
00:01:43,050 --> 00:01:44,970
尽量藏在中性层附近。
as close to that layer as they can.

55
00:01:44,970 --> 00:01:47,530
撕掉一层，整叠的厚度就变了，
Peel one layer, and the stack changes thickness.

56
00:01:47,530 --> 00:01:49,300
中性层也会跟着挪。
The neutral layer moves too.

57
00:01:49,300 --> 00:01:50,670
这是我们的推测：
That's our guess:

58
00:01:50,670 --> 00:01:53,360
时间长了，里面可能多受一点力。
over time, the inside might take a bit more strain.

59
00:01:53,360 --> 00:01:57,200
按常见折叠屏的结构，最外面那层专门挡划痕。
In a typical foldable, the outermost layer takes the scratches.

60
00:01:57,200 --> 00:01:59,880
撕了，下面那层就直接见人了。
Peel it, and the layer below faces the world bare.

61
00:01:59,880 --> 00:02:01,530
反转三，最反直觉：
Twist three, the weird one:

62
00:02:01,530 --> 00:02:04,400
撕了膜，屏幕反而更亮、更清楚。
peel it off and the screen looks brighter and sharper.

63
00:02:04,400 --> 00:02:06,140
因为磨砂面像毛玻璃，
Because a matte surface is like frosted glass.

64
00:02:06,140 --> 00:02:07,990
把光往四面八方散开。
It scatters light in every direction.

65
00:02:07,990 --> 00:02:09,160
反光不刺眼了，
Less glare,

66
00:02:09,160 --> 00:02:11,110
可画面也蒙上了一点雾。
but a slight haze over the picture.

67
00:02:11,110 --> 00:02:12,720
撕掉以后变成亮面，
Peel it, and the surface turns glossy,

68
00:02:12,720 --> 00:02:14,280
像镜子一样反光。
reflecting like a mirror.

69
00:02:14,280 --> 00:02:15,540
磨砂是漫反射，
Matte means diffuse reflection.

70
00:02:15,540 --> 00:02:17,110
亮面是镜面反射。
Glossy means mirror reflection.

71
00:02:17,110 --> 00:02:19,660
而镜子会把每一点起伏都照出来，
And a mirror shows every tiny bump,

72
00:02:19,660 --> 00:02:21,310
包括中间那道折痕。
including the crease down the middle.

73
00:02:21,310 --> 00:02:22,690
所以那层磨砂膜，
So that matte film

74
00:02:22,690 --> 00:02:24,530
其实也在帮你藏折痕。
was also hiding the crease.

75
00:02:24,530 --> 00:02:25,770
这就是为什么，
That's why,

76
00:02:25,770 --> 00:02:28,700
撕膜以后，很多人说折痕更明显了。
after peeling, many people say the crease got more obvious.

77
00:02:28,700 --> 00:02:31,210
有商家说这台手机没技术含量？
A reseller says this phone has no real tech in it?

78
00:02:31,210 --> 00:02:33,840
光这一层膜，就有这么多讲究。
This one film alone holds all of this.

79
00:02:33,840 --> 00:02:36,820
据报道，有人把它折了三万两千多次，
One reported test folded it over 32,000 times,

80
00:02:36,820 --> 00:02:38,350
手感没什么变化。
with no noticeable change.

81
00:02:38,350 --> 00:02:40,500
折叠屏最难的从来不是“折”，
The hard part of a foldable was never folding.

82
00:02:40,500 --> 00:02:42,460
而是折几万次以后还能平。
It's staying flat after tens of thousands of folds.

83
00:02:42,460 --> 00:02:44,590
友情提示：膜不是不能撕，
Friendly fine print: you can peel it,

84
00:02:44,590 --> 00:02:46,310
但撕了就回不去了。
but you can't un-peel it.

85
00:02:46,310 --> 00:02:48,380
想要亮面，先算算账：
Want glossy? Do the math first:

86
00:02:48,380 --> 00:02:51,800
398元，对比一块将近八千的屏。
398 yuan, versus a nearly 8,000-yuan screen.

87
00:02:51,800 --> 00:02:52,550
小折说：
Foldy says:

88
00:02:52,550 --> 00:02:55,550
我能对折，但请别撕我的铠甲。
I can bend in half, but please don't peel my armor.

